sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User Admin
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>UsersPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>DeleteUserAccountBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>DeleteUserAccountController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: delete an account
  UI->>B: DELETE /api/admin/users/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: delete(Integer adminId, Integer userId)
  alt own account
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>User: softDelete()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C->>User: save()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: void
  B-->>UI: 204 No Content
  UI-->>A: show result
  end